	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[could not change directory]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=27708#p27708"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />Quand je me connecte:</p><br /><div class="codebox"><pre><code>[postgres@rac1 root]$ psql postgres -d postgres</code></pre></div><p> je reçois le message</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>could not change directory to &quot;/root&quot;: Permission denied
psql (10.0)
Type &quot;help&quot; for help.

postgres=# </code></pre></div><p>D&#039;où ça vient?</p><p>D&#039;avance merci.</p>]]></content>
